Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='prodromedependency', at=datetime(2026, 10, 1, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title="The Prodrome is a dependency taken by revision, and the tab's wasm module is this repository's own", body="*The Prodrome is a dependency, not a directory*: https://github.com/fulfilium/prodrome, public under MIT OR Apache-2.0, taken BY REVISION in `app/Cargo.toml` (`prodrome-core`, `prodrome-wasm-exports` and `prodrome-typst-wasm`, the closed world) and by the same sha as `flake.nix`'s `inputs.prodrome`, so the crate the binary links and the wasm a tab fetches are one build. The tab's module is this repository's own (`app/wasm`, `nix build .#suzatary-wasm`, 2026-10-01): the Prodrome's exports generic over a schema, instantiated as `Todos` (`TodoEvent<Record>`, priced) and `Proposals` (`InboxEvent`), never the Prodrome's reference module, which reads a payload this application does not store. Its `SPEC.md` is the database's contract and its `conformance/` is FROZEN evidence with no generator. Not public: `app/conformance/` + `app/cli/tests/live.rs` (SPEC §9 against THIS box's `events/`, run by name by the merge gate's live half because the build sandbox has no chain).", rationale="The tab's module became this repository's own on 2026-10-01.", supersedes=()))